    "D1: the design source is OKLCH; a realization may store sRGB hex. These are the verified sRGB hex.",
    "The on-media set is MODE-INVARIANT: the media canvas is always dark, on both themes.",
    "Dark mode lowers chrome energy — primary becomes the dimmer #006045 — so media and status own the brightness. #006045 is a SURFACE colour; brand as INK in dark uses sidebarPrimary.",
    "The brand and neutral axes carry a fourth role, primaryText and mutedText, so each has an ink verified against its own soft surface — the shape every status already had. Both values are existing palette emeralds and mists given a role, not new colours."
  ],
